            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A display device, the device including a support panel including a body and a guide, the guide being on one side of the body; a protective cap spaced apart from the guide at one side of the support panel; a first substrate on the support panel; and a flexible printed circuit board on one side of the first substrate, wherein an accommodation space is defined between the protective cap and the guide, and the flexible printed circuit board is accommodated in the accommodation space.</p>
            </abstract>
